  "prefLabel": "Env-C 202.01 Applicant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 202.01 “Applicant” means the person who filed an application for a license or a request under RSA 72:12-a, as applicable to the proceeding.\n\nSource. #5860, eff 7-1-94; ss by #6960, eff 3-25-99; ss by #8851-A, eff 3-25-07",
